--- a/readme.md
+++ b/readme.md
@@ -87,6 +87,17 @@ Default: `[]`
 
 A single key (or array of keys) that should be parsed as `String`s.
 
+#### options['--']
+Type: `Boolean`<br>
+Default: `false`
+
+When enabled, arguments after a bare `--` are collected into `argv['--']` instead of `argv._`. The `argv['--']` array is always present (empty if no `--` was given).
+
+```js
+mri(['a', '--', 'b', '-c'], { '--': true });
+//=> { _: ['a'], '--': ['b', '-c'] }
+```
+
 #### options.unknown
 Type: `Function`<br>
 Default: `undefined`
